# Keep `railway up` uploads small and reproducible.
#
# Without this the CLI bundled 512 MB and Cloudflare rejected it with a 413 —
# almost all of it .git (553 MB of history) plus node_modules. Railway runs
# npm install during the build, so shipping node_modules is both wasted
# upload and a way to deploy a stale dependency tree.
.git
node_modules
out
test
fixtures
*.log
